			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Rename binary to 'Mountain', add PostHog telemetry, update Vine protocol to PascalCase\n\nMajor changes:\n1. Binary rename: `DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_Mountain` → `Mountain` in Cargo.toml, tauri.conf.json, and lib name\n2. PostHog integration: New PostHogPlugin.rs for debug-build analytics capturing lifecycle events, IPC commands, and errors to EU Cloud\n3. OTLP proxy: LocalhostPlugin now forwards /v1/traces requests to local OTLP collector (127.0.0.1:4318) via raw TCP, enabling OTELBridge.ts to send telemetry without CORS issues\n4. Vine protocol PascalCase: All RPC methods (e.g., `initial_handshake` → `InitialHandshake`) and message fields now follow the project's PascalCase convention, with regenerated vine.rs\n5. Cocoon bootstrap telemetry: bootstrap-fork.js now captures session events via PostHog and sends performance marks to OTLP proxy, with orphan detection for parent process\n\nMinor changes:\n- Remove `pub use` re-exports from NavigationHistoryState and WorkingCopyState modules\n- Add granular dev_log! tags to WindServiceHandlers (38 tags covering all IPC areas)\n- Update tauri.conf.json CSP to allow eu-assets.i.posthog.com\n- Remove externalBin (no longer needed)\n- Standardize comments: `--` → `-` for em-dash style\n\nThis enables fine-grained development debugging and crash telemetry while cleaning up the verbose binary naming.",
			"SHA": "f5b654911a9fb16204c41d93fb8999229ced6519"
		},
